{"unit_id":"guofug__dsh-fastswitch#card-zh","repo":"guofug/dsh-fastswitch","commit":"5cbd33f622fc55849a7f591714aa749981648442","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fastswitch 是面向 DSH 网页端的会话切换优化插件。它通过客户端模块改写打开会话时发出的首屏历史请求，并包装浏览器 fetch 来复用只读目录请求。主要功能包括缩小首屏历史窗口、缓存部分目录响应、合并短时间内的并发查询，以及通过 localStorage 调整窗口和缓存参数。适合希望减少长会话切换等待和页面初始化重复请求的 DSH 网页用户。插件使用浏览器本地设置，无需额外 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:69-99","client.js:104-194"]}
{"unit_id":"guofug__dsh-fastswitch#card-en","repo":"guofug/dsh-fastswitch","commit":"5cbd33f622fc55849a7f591714aa749981648442","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-fastswitch speeds up session switching in DSH web. It rewrites the opening history request and wraps fetch to cache read-only catalog calls and merge concurrent lookups. Users can tune history size and cache duration in localStorage. No API key or external service is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:69-99","client.js:104-194"]}
